stdout | tests/integration/doppler-inference.test.js > GPU Requirements Documentation > documents WebGPU tier levels

=== WebGPU Tier Levels ===

Tier 1 (Unified Memory):
  - Apple Silicon or similar unified memory architecture
  - Max Model Size: 60 GB
  - Features: memory64, subgroups, f16
  - Examples: M1/M2/M3 Mac, Snapdragon X Elite

Tier 2 (Memory64):
  - Discrete GPU with WebGPU memory64 support
  - Max Model Size: 40 GB (MoE models)
  - Features: memory64, subgroups
  - Examples: RTX 3090/4090, RX 7900 XTX

Tier 3 (Basic):
  - Entry-level WebGPU support
  - Max Model Size: 8 GB
  - Features: none
  - Examples: Integrated Intel/AMD GPUs, GTX 1060


